        "id": 7649,
        "name": "Tiny Brains",
        "summary": "\"Tiny Brains\" is a cooperative puzzle that follows four super-powered lab animals in their attempt to escape a mad scientist's experiments. In this joyously chaotic multiplayer game, the four \"Tiny Brains\" must combine their unique physics-based powers to navigate through a trick-ridden maze.\nAll of the puzzles in \"Tiny Brains\" can be solved multiple ways depending on how groups combine their powers.\nAttractive to both hardcore and casual fans, the game has competitive leaderboards and challenging fast paced communicative play along with simple controls so players of any level can jump right in.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2rp0.jpg",
