      {
        "id": 7729,
        "name": "Sound Shapes",
        "summary": "Play, Compose and Share in a unique take on the classic side-scrolling platformer where your actions make the music.\n\nEqual parts instrument and game, Sound Shapes gives everyone the ability to make music. Play through a unique campaign that fuses music and artwork into a classic 2D platformer, featuring artwork by Pixeljam, Capy, Superbrothers and more, with music by I Am Robot and Proud, Jim Guthrie and Deadmau5. Create your own unique musical levels with all of the campaign content and share with the world. Sound Shapes creates an ever-changing musical community for everyone to enjoy at home or on the go.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2itt.jpg",
