        "id": 37089,
        "name": "The Inpatient",
        "summary": "A twisting tale of terror. Life and death decisions\nOpen your eyes... and prepare yourself for the dread of unforgettable psychological horror. Set 60 years before the nerve-shredding events of \"Until Dawn\", you awaken in a strange medical facility, with no memory. It's up to you to discover why you're trapped within Blackwood Pines Sanatorium - and uncover a chilling conspiracy lurking within its shadows.",
